# Raw evidence — PostgreSQL multi-instance/crash/pool campaign (issue #1402)
# Date: 2026-11-26 (UTC+8 host clock; PG log timestamps CST)
# Host: VM-4-4-ubuntu, Linux 6.8.0-137-generic, 4 vCPU / 3.6 GiB
# PostgreSQL: 16.15 (Ubuntu), local cluster postgresql@16-main
# Web binary: oxo-flow-web 0.32.0, release, --features postgres, built from the campaign branch (this PR)
# CLI binary: oxo-flow 0.32.0, release (unchanged by this PR)
# Disposable database per probe: oxo_1402, dropped at the end of each script.
# Scripts are host-local and intentionally not committed; each probe's exact command is named below.

===== probe 1: per-user quota isolation (team mode) =====
# command: bash ~/probe1402-scripts/quota.sh
TOKENS admin=36 user=36
